==Description==
'''Shrug''', internally referred to as '''Shrug Scout''', is a sticker unlocked by reaching Level 9 of the regular track in the [[Spring Frenzy Battle Pass]]. At that Level, it cost {{Bunz|240}} or {{Robux|68}}. The total cost was {{Bunz|1,150}} or {{Robux|585}}.

==Appearance==
The sticker showcases a Level 0 default [[Scout]] shrugging.

==Trivia==
*The sticker is a reference to the yellow emoji shrug image.<ref>https://x.com/squeeezewhiz/status/2042035238675833228</ref>

